SOAPBOX: 15: 6-el mono OWA @25 m (82 ft.) + 4-el Yagi (in 4-bander AD-3446) @25 m (82 ft.) + 4-el Yagi (in 3-bander AD-346) @16 m (53 ft.) + 3-el SpiderBeam @25m (82 ft.)
